#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-reuse.php
msgid "Steel reuse market: offcuts, dismantled profiles, used tubes, plate offcuts, mixed lots and scrap. Adds the \"reuse\" market to the SM Products listing engine (condition scale, origin, surface state, cutting and loading), seeds its categories and adds the engineer advice on reuse listings. Requires SM Core, SM Weight Engine and SM Products."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: sm-reuse.php
msgid "ReuSteel"
msgstr ""

