msgid "SM Reuse needs the SM Core, SM Weight Engine and SM Products plugins. Activate them first."
msgstr ""

#: src/Advice.php:35
msgid "For recycling only"
msgstr ""

#: src/Advice.php:36
msgid "This lot is sold as scrap. It must not be used in a structure."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: platform name.
#: src/Advice.php:41
msgid "Used or surplus steel can be reused in a structure only after a check by a qualified engineer: condition of the elements, steel grade, holes, welds and corrosion. The information in this listing is declared by the seller; %s does not certify it."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: platform name.
#: src/Advice.php:44
msgid "The seller says these elements need an inspection or a treatment. Have them checked by a qualified engineer before any structural use. The information in this listing is declared by the seller; %s does not certify it."
msgstr ""

